WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/dashboard/widgets/shared/WidgetRankedList.tsx — a PURE presentational primitive
  (prompt: "Data sources: (none — pure presentational component)"). Imports @/components/ui (Badge),
  @/components/feedback (EmptyState).
    props : items, maxItems?, compact=false, showBars=true, emptyMessage='No data available', emptyIcon?
    derive: limit = maxItems ?? (compact ? 3 : 5) ; hideBars = compact || !showBars
            visible = [...items].sort((a,b)=>b.value-a.value).slice(0,limit)
            maxValue = visible.reduce(max, value)   ;  barPct = maxValue>0 ? value/maxValue*100 : 0
    render: visible.length===0 → <EmptyState icon message py-8/>           (branch A — empty)
            else <ul gap-1> rows: rank(idx+1, w-5 right muted) · label(trunc primary) · Badge? · value(semibold tabular)
                 with absolute bg bar width=barPct% opacity-15 color=barColor ?? bg-blue-400, min-h-[44px]  (branch B)
    badgeVariantMap: success→success, warning→warning, ERROR→danger, neutral→neutral
  NOTE: a presentational primitive owns NO data, so loading/error/stale/offline are the HOST widget's concern
  (identical to the shipped P4 ToolCard precedent). The two real source branches — populated list + empty
  state — are reproduced; nothing is narrowed and nothing extra is invented.

